# <%= it.scope %>/tsconfig

The TypeScript presets for every repo that uses <%= it.scope %>. Each file extends the matching preset of
[`@mfeflow/tsconfig`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@mfeflow/tsconfig), so change a setting for
everyone here and leave the rest to it.

| File                 | For                                         |
| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `base.json`          | any TypeScript project                      |
| `react-app.json`     | a React app (JSX, DOM libraries, no emit)   |
| `react-library.json` | a React library that publishes declarations |
| `node.json`          | a Node script or service                    |

In an app repo:

```json
{
  "extends": "<%= it.scope %>/tsconfig/react-app.json",
  "include": ["src"]
}
```

To add a setting for all your repos, put it in the file here, next to `extends`:

```json
{
  "extends": "@mfeflow/tsconfig/react-app.json",
  "compilerOptions": { "noUnusedLocals": true }
}
```
